# Stow local ignore list.
#
# WARNING: defining this file *replaces* stow's built-in default ignore list
# (it does not extend it). The defaults are therefore reproduced verbatim
# below, with a *.bak rule added at the end. If you remove the defaults,
# stow will start trying to symlink .git, README.md, etc. into the target.

# --- stow built-in defaults ---
RCS
.+,v

CVS
\.\#.+
\.cvsignore

\.svn
_darcs
\.hg

\.git
\.gitignore

.+~
\#.*\#

^/README.*
^/LICENSE.*
^/COPYING

# --- custom additions ---
# Editor/tool backup files (e.g. Claude Code's settings.json.bak)
.*\.bak
